            <ArticleTitle>Effective pain management in older patients.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>205-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Assessing and managing post-operative pain in older adult patients is complex. A baseline preoperative pain assessment provides the necessary data that assist appropriate and effective pain management. Careful monitoring and individualization of patient dosages result in effective older adult patient pain management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
